  #side-b
    .box
      %h1{:style => "font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 8px;"} Our Mission
      %p.big Turkopticon’s mission is to organize data workers to build collective power, improve working conditions, and hold platforms, companies, and institutions accountable to the labor they rely on.

      %h1{:style => "font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 8px;"} Vision
      %p.big We envision Turkopticon as a worker-led hub where data workers can find support, build power, and negotiate better working conditions.

      %h1{:style => "font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 12px;"} Our Values
      %p.big
        %strong Worker-Led:
        Our Organization is led by data workers, ensuring our advocacy, resources, and support reflect the real and current conditions workers face.
      %p.big
        %strong Inclusive:
        We provide assistance, resources, and advocacy to all data workers without discrimination and with respect for each worker’s human worth.
      %p.big
        %strong Collective Power:
        We believe data workers are stronger together. We build connections across platforms, borders, and experiences to support one another.
      %p.big
        %strong Horizontal Structure:
        We are committed to a structure where leadership is shared, voices are valued, and decisions are made with transparency and care.

      %h1{:style => "font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 24px; margin-bottom: 8px;"} Resources for Workers
      %p.big
        %ul
          %li <a href="https://reddit.com" target="_blank">Data Work on Reddit</a>
          %li <a href="https://techequitycollaborative.org" target="_blank">The Data Work Landscape by TechEquity</a>
          %li <a href="https://bsky.app" target="_blank">People/Orgs of Interest on Bluesky</a>
          %li <a href="#" target="_blank">Platforms’ TOS</a>

      %h1{:style => "font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 24px; margin-bottom: 8px;"} Stay Connected
      %p.big Follow Turkopticon for worker resources, campaign updates, news, and opportunities to take action.
      
